Findora 1.0: the first stable release. Faster start-up with a Baseline Profile, accessibility checks and screenshot tests on key screens, and every rent now shows its currency ("TND 12,000 / month"), converted with "≈" when you pick another currency in Settings. Also in this version: saved-search alerts, the Findora picks widget, owner mode, layouts for tablets and foldables, and a store listing in English, French and Arabic.
